IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INTEREST.
*> Nightly interest posting. Overdrawn accounts earn nothing and pay a fee.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT IN-FILE  ASSIGN TO "INPUT.DAT"  ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
    SELECT OUT-FILE ASSIGN TO "OUTPUT.DAT" ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD IN-FILE.
    COPY INREC.
FD OUT-FILE.
    COPY OUTREC.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-EOF  PIC X VALUE "N".
01 WS-INT  PIC S9(9)V99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    OPEN INPUT IN-FILE OUTPUT OUT-FILE
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = "Y"
        READ IN-FILE
            AT END MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF
            NOT AT END PERFORM PROCESS-PARA
        END-READ
    END-PERFORM
    CLOSE IN-FILE OUT-FILE
    STOP RUN.
PROCESS-PARA.
    MOVE IN-ACCT-ID TO OUT-ACCT-ID
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN IN-BALANCE > 0
            MOVE "P" TO OUT-STATUS
            COMPUTE WS-INT ROUNDED = IN-BALANCE * IN-RATE * IN-DAYS / 365
            COMPUTE OUT-NEW-BAL = IN-BALANCE + WS-INT
        WHEN IN-BALANCE < 0
            MOVE "O" TO OUT-STATUS
            MOVE 0 TO WS-INT
            COMPUTE OUT-NEW-BAL = IN-BALANCE - 25.00
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE "Z" TO OUT-STATUS
            MOVE 0 TO WS-INT
            MOVE 0 TO OUT-NEW-BAL
    END-EVALUATE
    MOVE WS-INT TO OUT-INTEREST
    WRITE OUT-REC.
